WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.955
Petty's projection conjecture.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.475
Every shadow of a solid, recorded in one

3
00:00:05.475 --> 00:00:07.815
body. Petty guessed ellipsoids make it smallest.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.439
Split the body into harmonic pieces and kill each degree in turn.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.909
Claimed: ellipsoids win, from dimension four up.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.127
Main theorem Lean-checked.
